    "description": "peptide-qc analyzes a standard peptide sequence and returns residue composition, elemental formula, average and monoisotopic mass, approximate charge and pI, and Kyte-Doolittle hydropathy. It is a deterministic command-line tool and JavaScript library for research software tests and teaching. It does not identify unknown samples, certify purity, model unusual chemistry or provide clinical interpretation.",
